IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. T. DATA DIVISION. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256). 01 G PIC X VALUE 'G' IS GLOBAL. PROCEDURE DIVISION. CALL 'S1'. DISPLAY G.
