    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "L"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [L] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. STOP RUN. IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. S1. DATA DIVISION. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION. 01 G PIC X VALUE 'L'. PROCEDURE DIVISION. DISPLAY G.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING G DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "G"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [G] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. EXIT PROGRAM. END PROGRAM S1. END PROGRAM T.

